### Since V2.0 every call except register needs login. Two ways work:
### - HTTP Basic on every call (used below for convenience). Replace "email adgangskode" with a registered user's
###   email and password. Users log in with the email; the username is only the name others see.
### - A JWT: call /api/auth/login once with Basic, then send "Authorization: Bearer <token>" (what the frontend does).

### Register a new player (open, no login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "brugernavn",
  "email": "mig@example.com",
  "password": "adgangskode"
}

### Log in: answers { token, expiresAt }. The token is valid for 60 minutes.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### The logged-in user, with the token from the login above
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Grid sizes to choose from, with the number of layouts per size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/grid-templates/sizes
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### The role matrix from the database (needs VIEW_STATS, i.e. ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/roles
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### All layouts (the backend picks one of the chosen size at random)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/grid-templates
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Create a new crossword (uses one fill of the monthly quota). playerPrompt is optional.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gridSize": 5,
  "playerPrompt": "dyr i skoven"
}

### List all saved crosswords (no quota used)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Get one crossword
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Start the clock for crossword 1 (the frontend does this when the crossword is shown)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/attempts
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

> {% client.global.set("attemptId", response.body.id); %}

### Submit a filled-in grid for crossword 1 ('.' = empty cell, '#' = black cell).
### The backend measures the time from the attempt above.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/submissions
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grid": ["AB#CD", "EFGHI", "JKLMN", "OPQRS", "TU#VW"],
  "attemptId": {{attemptId}}
}

### List all submissions for crossword 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/submissions
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Show one of your own submissions again (403 if it is someone else's)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/submissions/1
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Let Claude solve crossword 1. model is CHEAP_AND_DUMB, SMARTER_AND_PRICIER or TOTAL_TOKEN_KILLER.
### TOTAL_TOKEN_KILLER can take a few minutes.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/submissions/claude?model=CHEAP_AND_DUMB
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### What creating and solving crossword 1 cost (one row per external call)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crosswords/1/api-calls
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Admin only: all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode

### Admin only: total usage per external API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/usage
Authorization: Basic email adgangskode
